      "fix": "Plan claims max-of with existing AUCTION/PRE_FORECLOSURE signals but provides no code path. If FUTURE_AUCTION(+25) stacks ADDITIVELY on top of an existing AUCTION signal that already scored the parcel, every scheduled foreclosure will pin at score ~95+ = grade A, defeating the prioritization purpose. Hard gate: write the v2.1 scorer with an explicit signal-family enum (FORECLOSURE_FAMILY = {AUCTION, FUTURE_AUCTION, LIS_PENDENS, PRE_FORECLOSURE}) and take MAX within family before summing across families. Add a unit test asserting a scheduled+lis_pendens parcel scores ≤ max(25,22)+other-family-contributions, not 47+other."
